{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32151","headline":"湘东宴曲 · 温庭筠","name":"湘东宴曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘东夜宴金貂人，楚女含情娇翠嚬。\n玉管将吹插钿带，锦囊斜拂双麒麟。\n重城漏断孤帆去，唯恐琼签报天曙。\n万户沈沈碧树圆，云飞雨散知何处。\n欲上香车俱脉脉，清歌响断银屏隔。\n堤外红尘蜡炬归，楼前澹月连江白。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}